    "Nodus Reader is local-first by design.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nodus Reader está diseñado para funcionar en local."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nodus Reader never sees your password. To remove its access, open Connected Apps in your Hugging Face settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nodus Reader nunca ve tu contraseña. Para retirarle el acceso, abre Connected Apps en los ajustes de Hugging Face."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nodus Reader uses the voices already installed by the operating system. Neural Kokoro and Phonon voices are downloaded separately and also stay on this device.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nodus Reader usa las voces que ya instala el sistema operativo. Las voces neuronales de Kokoro y Phonon se descargan aparte y también se quedan en este dispositivo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nodus Reader's shared container is not available. Open the app once and check the App Group entitlement.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El contenedor compartido de Nodus Reader no está disponible. Abre la app una vez y comprueba el permiso del grupo de apps."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nodus narrates with neural voices that run entirely on this device. Download a voice model to start listening offline.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nodus narra con voces neuronales que funcionan íntegramente en este dispositivo. Descarga un modelo de voz para empezar a escuchar sin conexión."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not available in this version of Nodus Reader: there is no Core ML version of this model that runs on Apple devices yet. Accepting the licence now only gives your account access for later.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
